<p>Release a surge of entropy, cleansing yourself of afflictions while draining the energy from others. All enemies in range 10 will have the duration of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> beneficial effects reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns, while you will have an equal number of detrimental effects reduced by the same duration.</p>